# Python / uv

- Python is pinned in `.python-version`. Change it with `uv python pin`, not by editing files by hand unless necessary.
- Add runtime deps with `uv add <package>`. Add dev tools with `uv add --dev <package>`.
- Install with `uv sync --frozen` (see `scripts/install.sh`). Run tools with `uv run ...`.
- Do not commit `.venv/`.
- Lint with `uv run ruff check`.
- Local dataset download: `uv run ir-spark-download`
- Local Phase 2 sample: `uv run ir-spark-sample`
- Local Phase 2 DQ profile: `uv run ir-spark-profile`
- Local Phase 1 smoke: `uv run ir-spark-smoke`
- Databricks notebooks under `notebooks/` may use `%pip install splink` because that runtime is not this uv environment. Keep local Python on uv.
